---
import Page from "../layouts/page.astro";
import IoIcon from "../icons/io.svg";
---

<Page>
  <h1 class="text-balance wght-500 dark:wght-450" data-fade>
    Hi, I&apos;m Kevin.
  </h1>
  <p
    class="leading-relaxed text-pretty text-muted wght-450 dark:wght-400"
    data-fade
    data-fade-kind="body"
  >
    A software engineer who enjoys building thoughtful digital experiences, with a focus on frontend
    development, performance, and the details that make an interface feel right.
  </p>
  <p
    class="leading-relaxed text-pretty text-muted wght-450 dark:wght-400"
    data-fade
    data-fade-kind="body"
  >
    I like turning ideas into polished products, making the web faster, and exploring how design and
    engineering come together to create better experiences.
  </p>
  <p
    class="leading-relaxed text-pretty text-muted wght-450 dark:wght-400"
    data-fade
    data-fade-kind="body"
  >
    I work at{" "}
    <a
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="relative inline-block text-foreground decoration-primary after:absolute after:-bottom-0.5 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-full after:bg-primary after:opacity-0 hover:after:opacity-100"
      href="https://iodigital.com/"
    >
      <IoIcon aria-hidden="true" class="block-[1cap]" />
      <span class="sr-only">iO</span>
    </a>
    , and after hours I build things through{" "}
    <a
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-foreground decoration-primary hover:underline hover:underline-offset-2"
      href="https://revolveddesign.com/"
    >
      Revolved Design
    </a>
    , my own studio for digital products and websites. One of its projects is{" "}
    <a
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-foreground decoration-primary hover:underline hover:underline-offset-2"
      href="https://tune-tracker.com/"
    >
      Tune Tracker
    </a>
    , a music tracking platform for Spotify users.
  </p>
  <p
    class="leading-relaxed text-pretty text-muted wght-450 dark:wght-400"
    data-fade
    data-fade-kind="body"
  >
    My code for personal projects is on{" "}
    <a
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="text-foreground decoration-primary hover:underline hover:underline-offset-2"
      href="https://github.com/NSMNIA/"
    >
      GitHub
    </a>
    , you can find me on{" "}
    <a
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="text-foreground decoration-primary hover:underline hover:underline-offset-2"
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinstoop/"
    >
      LinkedIn
    </a>
    , and my inbox is open at{" "}
    <a
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="text-foreground decoration-primary hover:underline hover:underline-offset-2"
      href="mailto:hello@kevinstoop.com"
    >
      hello@kevinstoop.com
    </a>
    .
  </p>
</Page>
